UP032: `"{.;:F}".format(x)` was converted to an invalid f-string; only identifiers can be
accessed as attributes.
Regression test included; fuzz repro: repro/fix-up032-attribute-identifier.py (ruff_fix_validity).

diff --git a/crates/ruff_linter/resources/test/fixtures/pyupgrade/UP032_0.py b/crates/ruff_linter/resources/test/fixtures/pyupgrade/UP032_0.py
